OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACelebrity shark guided out of South
OL,4,AKorea canal refuses to swim out to sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, authorities said they had
OL,7,Freinforced barriers to prevent Bukangi
OL,8,Ffrom returning. But it has yet to swim
OL,9,Fout into the open sea, and has been
OL,10,Fcircling back repeatedly to the mouth
OL,11,Fof the waterway.
OL,13,FIts rescue prompted mixed reactions in
OL,14,FBusan, where some said the shark should
OL,15,Fstay while others felt it was better
OL,16,Ffor it to go.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
